Hi Paul,

Sorry about that.

The comparisons I am interested in are the main effects and their interactions, but since their is no "statistical cost" to asking for more comparisons, it would be nice to have an output for all the main effects and their interactions plus every combination in between.

The desired output could be similar to what is currently available from the multcomp package for post-hoc tests using the following:

summary(glht(model, linfct=mcp(SHD="Tukey")))

cheers,

Kate

